text":"Male","links":[]},{"name":"hair","value_wikitext":"Brown","value_text":"Brown","links":[]},{"name":"eyes","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Memory Lane]]\"","value_text":"\"Memory Lane\"","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]}],"start":0,"end":192}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Unnamed Suit 042 accompanied [[Rassimov]] and [[The Professor]] in [[King Solomon's mines]] to retrieve the ring of [[Tao]], the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] but was defeated along the other Suits. {{Source|S1E23}}","text":"Unnamed Suit 042 accompanied Rassimov and The Professor in King Solomon's mines to retrieve the ring of Tao, the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked Ammit Heart-Eater but was defeated along the other Suits. [S1E23]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells."},{"heading":"Spells","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Boltflare]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost\n• Boltflare"},{"heading":"Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Ammit Heart-Eater]]\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n* [[Sekhmet]]\n\n{{col-end}}","text":"• Ammit Heart-Eater\n• Bonelasher\n• Enforcer\n• Redcap\n• Sekhmet"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* He has a Russian accent.\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• He has a Russian accent."}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 042 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by Rassimov.\n\nHistory\n\nUnnamed Suit 042 accompanied Rassimov and The Professor in King Solomon's mines to retrieve the ring of Tao, the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked Ammit Heart-Eater but was defeated along the other Suits. [S1E23]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\nSpells\n\n• Augerfrost\n• Boltflare\n\nTitans\n\n• Ammit Heart-Eater\n• Bonelasher\n• Enforcer\n• Redcap\n• Sekhmet\n\nTrivia\n\n• He has a Russian accent.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 042.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Brown\n| eyes   = \n| first  = \"[[Memory Lane]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 042''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[Rassimov]].\n\n== History ==\nUnnamed Suit 042 accompanied [[Rassimov]] and [[The Professor]] in [[King Solomon's mines]] to retrieve the ring of [[Tao]], the Legendary Titan of Spirit. He invoked [[Ammit Heart-Eater]] but was defeated along the other Suits. {{Source|S1E23}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Boltflare]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Titans ===\n* [[Ammit Heart-Eater]]\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n* [[Enforcer]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n* [[Sekhmet]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* He has a Russian accent.\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:5037","status":"resolved","target_title"